    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald are delighted to bring 43 The Phoenix to the market. \n\nThis spacious two-bedroom luxury apartment is set in this prestigious and well established residential development in the heart of Islandbridge. Recently renovated and beautifully presented throughout with stunning river views, it is perfectly suited for the astute professional, the investor or those looking to trade down. Drenched with natural sunlight, the accommodation briefly comprises; entrance hall with storage and separate hot press, modern fitted kitchen, open plan living/dining room, two large double bedrooms (one with balcony access) and a shower room completing the accommodation. The property boasts magnificent views over the River Liffey as well as landscaped communal gardens with seating areas overlooking the water.\n\nRiverpark is a sought after, quiet and carefully maintained modern apartment development enjoying a wealth of amenities both social and essential, with local leisure and retail attractions including Heuston South Quarter (which includes a large Supervalu, pharmacy and coffee shop), Phoenix Park, Kilmainham Goal, War Memorial Gardens, The Irish Museum of Modern Art, the Hilton Hotel and Leisure Centre. Riverpark is also close to Parkgate Street with its range of restaurants including FX Buckley at Ryans, Provender & Family and the Natural Bakery. Union 8 are also within walking distance as part of nearby Clancy Quay. Other amenities include excellent transport facilities, a selection of bus routes, the Luas and Heuston station being just about ten minutes' walk away, and superb access to both sides of the city centre, the M50 and many major national routes"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance - 1.13m x 4.84m\nSpacious hallway with hotpress and separate storage cupboard\n\nLiving Room - 5.17m x 2.94m\nOpen plan layout with river views and electric fireplace providing a focal point\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 2.56m x 3.49m\nFloor and eye level units with tiled splashback and built in shelving\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.71m x 2.74m\nDouble bedroom with built in wardrobes and French doors to balcony. The balcony is south facing and laid in decking. It is a wonderful area to relax or al fresco dining\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.68m x 2.72m\nDouble bedroom with built in wardrobes and river views\n\nShower Room - 1.52m x 2.33m\nModern suite with vanity whb, wc, built in storage and rainwater shower\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Management fee: 2,994.89 per annum</li><li>Beautifully presented light-filled two bedroom apartment</li><li>Panoramic views over the River Liffey and landscaped communal gardens</li><li>South facing aspect </li><li>Balcony access off the bedroom</li><li>Private gated development</li><li>Easy access to the city centre</li><li>Excellent location with many amenities within walking distance</li><li>TV, wifi & telephone points</li><li>Electric heating all new electric radiators</li><li>Renovated shower room</li><li>New flooring with insulation throughout the apartment</ul>"
      },
      {
